WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.571
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is The Invisible String.

00:00:13.571 --> 00:00:19.142
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:22.484
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:22.484 --> 00:00:25.827
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:25.827 --> 00:00:33.626
Here is an idea to carry with you. Between you and the people you love, there is an invisible string.

00:00:33.626 --> 00:00:42.539
You cannot see it. You cannot touch it with your hands. But it is made of something real: love.

00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:52.566
The string connects you to your people — the ones in this room, and the ones far away. Wherever they are, the string reaches.

00:00:52.566 --> 00:00:57.023
Let me show you how the string works.

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:07.051
The string stretches. Across a classroom. Across a city. Across an ocean. No distance is too far for it.

00:01:07.051 --> 00:01:17.078
The string never breaks. People can move, days can change, you can grow — the string stays.

00:01:17.078 --> 00:01:27.105
When you miss someone, you might feel a little tug. That tug is the string, reminding you: the love is still there.

00:01:27.105 --> 00:01:36.019
And it works both ways. When you think of someone with love, they can feel a tug on their end too.

00:01:36.019 --> 00:01:37.133
The string is quiet. It asks for nothing. It just connects — your heart to theirs.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:47.160
Hear this part clearly: the string carries love. It is not for watching, and it is not for checking. Nobody looks through the string.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:57.188
Your string can reach anyone you love — family, a friend, a teacher, someone who moved far away.

00:01:57.188 --> 00:02:04.987
It can even reach someone who died and lives now in your memory and your heart. The love does not end. Neither does the string.

00:02:04.987 --> 00:02:06.101
Nobody here will ask who your string connects to. That is yours. You can just feel it, quietly, inside.

00:02:06.101 --> 00:02:13.900
Made of love. It stretches. It never breaks.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:19.471
Shoulders soft. Let your body rest.

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:23.928
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:23.928 --> 00:02:29.499
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:29.499 --> 00:02:35.069
You're ready for what's next.
